Fixed the markdownlint CI failure on PR #27.

**Root cause:** `docs/pr-summary-13.md` lines 40–42 contained trailing spaces
inside table cells to visually align columns (e.g. `Bootstrap JS  |`,
`Chart.js      |`, `Date adapter  |`). The markdownlint rule MD060
(table-column-style) enforces compact table style, which disallows extra
whitespace before the closing pipe character.

**Fix:** Removed the trailing alignment spaces from the three affected rows so
each cell is written in compact form (`Bootstrap JS |`, `Chart.js |`,
`Date adapter |`). No rule suppression was applied — the underlying violation
was corrected directly.

**Verification:** `markdownlint-cli2` now reports `Summary: 0 error(s)` across
all 22 markdown files in the repository.
